{"timestamp":"2026-08-31T09:00:43.603Z","ordinal":373,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a056fa-3d7c-75f3-90fe-5efec27b184d","turn_id":"01a0570a-0a07-7960-a515-846514f6040a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-3c3b1e5b-4a69-48f0-aafc-95e70d1db038","process_id":"97243","command":["/bin/bash","-lc","docker exec tiered-serve bash -lc '\ncd /root/projects/tiered-serve\nprintf \"%s\\n\" \"--- stable OFFLINE_GUIDE correctness sections ---\"\ngit show HEAD:docs/OFFLINE_GUIDE.md | sed -n \"45,195p\"\nprintf \"%s\\n\" \"--- stable EXPERIMENT_GUIDE correctness sections ---\"\ngit show HEAD:docs/EXPERIMENT_GUIDE.md | sed -n \"70,225p\"\nprintf \"%s\\n\" \"--- fixed prompt ---\"\ngit show HEAD:benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt\n'"],"cwd":"file:///home/ubuntu","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"docker exec tiered-serve bash -lc '\ncd /root/projects/tiered-serve\nprintf \"%s\\n\" \"--- stable OFFLINE_GUIDE correctness sections ---\"\ngit show HEAD:docs/OFFLINE_GUIDE.md | sed -n \"45,195p\"\nprintf \"%s\\n\" \"--- stable EXPERIMENT_GUIDE correctness sections ---\"\ngit show HEAD:docs/EXPERIMENT_GUIDE.md | sed -n \"70,225p\"\nprintf \"%s\\n\" \"--- fixed prompt ---\"\ngit show HEAD:benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt\n'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"--- stable OFFLINE_GUIDE correctness sections ---\n통과해야 한다. 새 shell을 사용하고 이전 실험의 KV codec/layout 설정을\n물려받지 않도록 다음 값을 비운다.\n\n```bash\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_COMP_PRODUCER\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_BLOB_STRIDE\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_BLOB_SLACK\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_COMP_PREFILL_LOAD\nunset TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_SIZE_GB\n```\n\nCorrectness 예제는 고정 prompt로 2 tokens를 만들고 `Paris`를 semantic\noracle로 사용한다. Batch 1 full-block KV compression은 logical `D=16`,\ntail `S=1`, physical offset `D+S=17`이므로 dedicated-row request는 17,\nplanner override는 1025를 사용한다.\n\n## 2. 네 기능을 켠 correctness 실행\n\n### 2.1 8B\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS=17 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_KV_FULL_BLOCK_ONLY=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN=/tmp/tiered-offline-8b-all-on \\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python offline_offload_kvweight.py \\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\\n  --dtype bfloat16 \\\n  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\\n  --block-size 16 \\\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\n  --batch 1 \\\n  --gen 2 \\\n  --fixed-generation-length \\\n  --prompt-file benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt \\\n  --expect-text Paris \\\n  --num-gpu-blocks-override 1025 \\\n  --time-breakdown \\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\n  --fused-mm \\\n  --kv-comp p4flat \\\n  --ts-configs all-offload-compressed-p4\n```\n\n### 2.2 70B\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE=14 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS=17 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_KV_FULL_BLOCK_ONLY=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN=/tmp/tiered-offline-70b-all-on \\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python offline_offload_kvweight.py \\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct \\\n  --dtype bfloat16 \\\n  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\\n  --block-size 16 \\\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\n  --batch 1 \\\n  --gen 2 \\\n  --fixed-generation-length \\\n  --prompt-file benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt \\\n  --expect-text Paris \\\n  --num-gpu-blocks-override 1025 \\\n  --time-breakdown \\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\n  --fused-mm \\\n  --kv-comp p4flat \\\n  --ts-configs flexgen-comp-p4\n```\n\n두 명령은 weight offload, KV offload, weight compression, KV compression을\n모두 사용한다. P4Flat `offload_compressed` weight는 현재 dense\ndecompress+matmul을 사용하며, log의 explicit fallback marker와\n`WDecomp>0`이 기대값이다. `--fused-mm` 요청 자체는 startup marker로\n확인한다.\n\n## 3. Fused-MM override를 직접 확인\n\nP4Flat fused override 자체를 확인하려면 compressed weight를 지원되는\nresidency에 둔다. KV는 HBM에 고정해 weight route만 분리한다.\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN=/tmp/tiered-offline-8b-fused \\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python offline_offload_kvweight.py \\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\\n  --dtype bfloat16 \\\n  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\\n  --block-size 16 \\\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\n  --batch 1 \\\n  --gen 2 \\\n  --fixed-generation-length \\\n  --prompt-file benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt \\\n  --expect-text Paris \\\n  --num-gpu-blocks-override 1024 \\\n  --time-breakdown \\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\n  --fused-mm \\\n  --ts-configs all-frozen-compressed-p4 \\\n  --no-offload-kv\n```\n\n70B에서는 같은 명령의 모델, page 수와 config를 다음처럼 바꾼다.\n\n| 항목 | 8B | 70B |\n|---|---|---|\n| `--model` | `meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct` | `meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct` |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE` | `2` | `14` |\n| `--ts-configs` | `all-frozen-compressed-p4` | `all-frozen-split-p4` |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN` | `/tmp/tiered-offline-8b-fused` | `/tmp/tiered-offline-70b-fused` |\n\n같은 config를 `--fused-mm` 없이 별도 fresh process로 실행하고 dump prefix를\n`*-dense`로 바꾼 뒤 token도 비교한다.\n\n```bash\ncmp /tmp/tiered-offline-8b-dense.b1.json \\\n    /tmp/tiered-offline-8b-fused.b1.json\ncmp /tmp/tiered-offline-70b-dense.b1.json \\\n    /tmp/tiered-offline-70b-fused.b1.json\n```\n\n합격 기준은 두 run의 `[semantic-answer] PASS`, token equality와 fused run의\n`fused_mm: installed forward override` marker다. 위 batch-1 P4Flat 두\nprofile에서는 decode `WDecomp=0`도 기대한다.\n\n## 4. 출력과 성능 실행\n\n기본 출력은 다음 위치에 생성된다.\n\n```text\nlogs/offline/<model-id>/<config>/<timestamp>/\n├── PCIe_<batch>.log\n├── <timestamp>_<config>.csv\n└── breakdown.csv              # --time-breakdown 사용 시\n\n/tmp/tiered-offline-*.b1.json  # TIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN 사용 시\n```\n\n`--time-breakdown`은 H2D timing path에 serialization과 CUDA-event overhead를\n추가하므로 성능 자료로 사용하지 않는다. Correctness가 통과한 뒤 같은 명령에서\n`--gen 2 --time-breakdown`을 `--gen 129 --warmup 16`으로 바꾸고 fresh\nprocess로 최소 3회 반복한다. 모델, prompt, batch, KV topology와 config는\n비교하는 run 사이에 고정한다.\n\n--- stable EXPERIMENT_GUIDE correctness sections ---\n\n./.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\nimport torch\nimport vllm\nimport tiered_serve\n\nprint(\"vllm:\", vllm.__file__)\nprint(\"tiered_serve:\", tiered_serve.__file__)\nprint(\"cuda:\", torch.cuda.is_available())\nPY\n```\n\nSibling vLLM과 현재 tiered-serve가 import되고, 같은 실행 경계에서 CUDA가\n보이며, 16 GiB hugepage mount가 read-write 상태여야 한다. Patch/ABI\n확인은 [구조 가이드](LANDING_GUIDE.md)를 따른다.\n\nGPU E2E를 시작하기 전에 YAML/CLI 매핑만 빠르게 검사한다.\n\n```bash\n./.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/test_feature_matrix_e2e.py\n```\n\n환경변수를 지정하지 않으면 model E2E test는 의도적으로 skip된다.\n\n## 4. Feature matrix 실행\n\n각 cell은 `--fused-mm`을 포함한 fresh process에서 batch 1, 생성 2\ntokens로 실행된다. Prompt는 `benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt`이고\n정답에 `Paris`가 포함되어야 한다.\n\n### 4.1 8B 전체 12개\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_RUN_FEATURE_MATRIX_E2E=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_REQUIRE_EXACT_TOKENS=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_OUTPUT=\"$PWD/benchmark_results/feature_matrix\" \\\n  LD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\n  ./.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -s tests/test_feature_matrix_e2e.py\n```\n\n### 4.2 70B 전체 6개\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_RUN_FEATURE_MATRIX_E2E=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_MODEL=meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct \\\nTIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_REQUIRE_EXACT_TOKENS=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_OUTPUT=\"$PWD/benchmark_results/feature_matrix\" \\\n  LD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\n  ./.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -s tests/test_feature_matrix_e2e.py\n```\n\n### 4.3 70B 대표 누적 4개\n\n전체 6개가 필요하지 않다면 weight offload → raw KV offload → weight\ncompression → KV compression 순서만 실행한다.\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_RUN_FEATURE_MATRIX_E2E=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_MODEL=meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct \\\nTIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_CASES=wo1-ko0-wc0-kc0,wo1-ko1-wc0-kc0,wo1-ko1-wc1-kc0,wo1-ko1-wc1-kc1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_REQUIRE_EXACT_TOKENS=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_OUTPUT=\"$PWD/benchmark_results/feature_matrix\" \\\n  LD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\n  ./.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -s tests/test_feature_matrix_e2e.py\n```\n\n`TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_CASES`로 다른 subset도 선택할 수 있다.\nExact-token mode에서는 canonical baseline을 반드시 포함해야 한다.\n\n- 8B baseline: `wo0-ko0-wc0-kc0`\n- 70B baseline: `wo1-ko0-wc0-kc0`\n\n## 5. 옵션과 결과\n\n| 환경변수 | 의미 |\n|---|---|\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_OUTPUT` | log/token/summary 출력 루트 |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_CASES` | comma-separated case ID filter |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_REQUIRE_EXACT_TOKENS=1` | baseline과 token IDs까지 동일해야 통과 |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_TIMEOUT` | cell별 timeout, 기본 1800초 |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_NUMACTL=0` | 자동 `numactl -m 0` 사용 중지 |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGES` | 기본 8B=2, 70B=14 override |\n\n출력 구조:\n\n```text\n$OUTPUT/<model>/\n├── feature_matrix.summary.json\n├── <case-id>.log\n└── tokens.<case-id>.b1.json\n```\n\n각 valid cell은 다음을 검사한다.\n\n1. `[semantic-answer] PASS`와 generated-token artifact\n2. `qkv`, `o`, `gate_up`, `down` residency가 요청한 weight state와 일치\n3. Weight/KV compressor와 full-block marker의 ON/OFF 일치\n4. Fused-MM 요청 marker와 예상 override/dense-fallback 개수\n5. Decode `WLoad`, `KVLoad`, `WDecomp`, `KVDecomp`의 기대값\n6. Exact-token mode에서 canonical baseline과 token IDs 일치\n\nFused-MM log contract와 현재 batch-1 P4Flat 기대 count는 다음과 같다.\n\n| 구분 | Marker | 8B | 70B |\n|---|---|---:|---:|\n| 요청 | `##### Using Fused MM` | 모든 cell에 1 | 모든 cell에 1 |\n| `frozen_compressed` override | `fused_mm: installed forward override` | 128 | 해당 없음 |\n| `offload_compressed` fallback | `fused_mm: offload fused unsupported for per-threshold codec P4FlatCompressor` | 128 | 160 |\n\nCount는 해당 weight state를 쓰는 cell에서의 값이며 KV state가 바뀌어도\n같다. Raw-weight cell은 override와 fallback 모두 0이다.\n\n현재 batch-1 P4Flat matrix의 route 기대값은 다음과 같다.\n\n| 기능 | OFF | ON |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| Weight offload | `WLoad=0` | `WLoad>0` |\n| KV offload | `KVLoad=0` | `KVLoad>0` |\n| Weight compression | `WDecomp=0` | fused override이면 `WDecomp=0`, dense fallback이면 `WDecomp>0` |\n| KV compression | `KVDecomp=0` | `KVDecomp>0` |\n\n`O>0`은 offload capacity만 뜻한다. KV 검증에는 요청이 실제 offloadable\nblock을 사용하고 `KVLoad>0`이어야 한다.\n\n## 6. 검증 범위\n\n이 matrix는 correctness와 route smoke다.\n\n- `--time-breakdown`이 켜진 계측 실행이므로 성능 비교 자료가 아니다.\n- Exact-token 검사는 한 matrix 실행 안의 cell 간 비교다. Race 검증에는\n  matrix 자체를 여러 번 실행해 artifact를 비교해야 한다.\n- 70B에서는 weight-offload OFF 여섯 valid cell을 검증하지 않는다.\n- Fused-MM은 고정 ON이며 별도 ON/OFF 축은 아니다. 현재 P4Flat\n  `offload_compressed` cell은 명시적인 dense fallback을 사용하므로 70B\n  matrix는 fused request와 fallback을 검증한다.\n- ATS와 `--reduce-kv-footprint`는 별도 실험이므로 matrix에서 제외한다.\n- Mixed-prefill은 기본적으로 raw secondary KV를 읽을 수 있다.\n  `vllm_offload_kvweight_prefill.py`는 해당 phase와 active-block 진단용이며\n  기본 answer matrix를 대신하지 않는다.\n\n성능은 correctness 통과 후 동일한 topology로 별도 normal pass를 최소\n3회 실행한다. 예를 들어 생성 길이를 `--gen 129 --warmup 16`으로 늘리고\nnormal pass에는 `--time-breakdown`을 사용하지 않는다. 원인 분석이 필요할\n때만 같은 조건의 별도 instrumentation pass를 추가한다.\n--- fixed prompt ---\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\nThis neutral validation context is intentionally repeated so that the key-value cache spans many complete blocks. It does not contain the answer to the final question.\n\nWhat is the capital of France? Reply with only the city name.\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"--- stable OFFLINE_GUIDE correctness sections ---\n통과해야 한다. 새 shell을 사용하고 이전 실험의 KV codec/layout 설정을\n물려받지 않도록 다음 값을 비운다.\n\n```bash\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_COMP_PRODUCER\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_BLOB_STRIDE\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_BLOB_SLACK\nunset TIERED_SERVE_KV_COMP_PREFILL_LOAD\nunset TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_SIZE_GB\n```\n\nCorrectness 예제는 고정 prompt로 2 tokens를 만들고 `Paris`를 semantic\noracle로 사용한다. Batch 1 full-block KV compression은 logical `D=16`,\ntail `S=1`, physical offset `D+S=17`이므로 dedicated-row request는 17,\nplanner override는 1025를 사용한다.\n\n## 2. 네 기능을 켠 correctness 실행\n\n### 2.1 8B\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS=17 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_KV_FULL_BLOCK_ONLY=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN=/tmp/tiered-offline-8b-all-on \\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python offline_offload_kvweight.py \\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\\n  --dtype bfloat16 \\\n  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\\n  --block-size 16 \\\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\n  --batch 1 \\\n  --gen 2 \\\n  --fixed-generation-length \\\n  --prompt-file benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt \\\n  --expect-text Paris \\\n  --num-gpu-blocks-override 1025 \\\n  --time-breakdown \\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\n  --fused-mm \\\n  --kv-comp p4flat \\\n  --ts-configs all-offload-compressed-p4\n```\n\n### 2.2 70B\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE=14 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS=17 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_KV_FULL_BLOCK_ONLY=1 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN=/tmp/tiered-offline-70b-all-on \\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python offline_offload_kvweight.py \\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct \\\n  --dtype bfloat16 \\\n  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\\n  --block-size 16 \\\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\n  --batch 1 \\\n  --gen 2 \\\n  --fixed-generation-length \\\n  --prompt-file benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt \\\n  --expect-text Paris \\\n  --num-gpu-blocks-override 1025 \\\n  --time-breakdown \\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\n  --fused-mm \\\n  --kv-comp p4flat \\\n  --ts-configs flexgen-comp-p4\n```\n\n두 명령은 weight offload, KV offload, weight compression, KV compression을\n모두 사용한다. P4Flat `offload_compressed` weight는 현재 dense\ndecompress+matmul을 사용하며, log의 explicit fallback marker와\n`WDecomp>0`이 기대값이다. `--fused-mm` 요청 자체는 startup marker로\n확인한다.\n\n## 3. Fused-MM override를 직접 확인\n\nP4Flat fused override 자체를 확인하려면 compressed weight를 지원되는\nresidency에 둔다. KV는 HBM에 고정해 weight route만 분리한다.\n\n```bash\nTIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_N_WEIGHT_BUFFERS=2 \\\nTIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN=/tmp/tiered-offline-8b-fused \\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python offline_offload_kvweight.py \\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\\n  --dtype bfloat16 \\\n  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\\n  --block-size 16 \\\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\n  --batch 1 \\\n  --gen 2 \\\n  --fixed-generation-length \\\n  --prompt-file benchmarks/staged_correctness_prompt.txt \\\n  --expect-text Paris \\\n  --num-gpu-blocks-override 1024 \\\n  --time-breakdown \\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\n  --fused-mm \\\n  --ts-configs all-frozen-compressed-p4 \\\n  --no-offload-kv\n```\n\n70B에서는 같은 명령의 모델, page 수와 config를 다음처럼 바꾼다.\n\n| 항목 | 8B | 70B |\n|---|---|---|\n| `--model` | `meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct` | `meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct` |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_NUM_WEIGHT_HUGE_PAGE` | `2` | `14` |\n| `--ts-configs` | `all-frozen-compressed-p4` | `all-frozen-split-p4` |\n| `TIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN` | `/tmp/tiered-offline-8b-fused` | `/tmp/tiered-offline-70b-fused` |\n\n같은 config를 `--fused-mm` 없이 별도 fresh process로 실행하고 dump prefix를\n`*-dense`로 바꾼 뒤 token도 비교한다.\n\n```bash\ncmp /tmp/tiered-offline-8b-dense.b1.json \\\n    /tmp/tiered-offline-8b-fused.b1.json\ncmp /tmp/tiered-offline-70b-dense.b1.json \\\n    /tmp/tiered-offline-70b-fused.b1.json\n```\n\n합격 기준은 두 run의 `[semantic-answer] PASS`, token equality와 fused run의\n`fused_mm: installed forward override` marker다. 위 batch-1 P4Flat 두\nprofile에서는 decode `WDecomp=0`도 기대한다.\n\n## 4. 출력과 성능 실행\n\n기본 출력은 다음 위치에 생성된다.\n\n```text\nlogs/offline/<model-id>/<config>/<timestamp>/\n├── PCIe_<batch>.log\n├── <timestamp>_<config>.csv\n└── breakdown.csv              # --time-breakdown 사용 시\n\n/tmp/tiered-offline-*.b1.json  # TIERED_SERVE_DUMP_GEN 사용 시\n```\n\n`--time-breakdown`은 H2D timing path에 serialization과 CUDA-event overhead를\n추가